      *################################################################*00890019
       F7919010-C100-Valider-Dato        Section.                       00900019
      *                                                                 00910019
      * Sjekker skuddår:                                                00920019
      *                                                                 00930019
           Move  W9010-C100-Dato         To    W9010-C300-Dato          00940019
           Perform F7919010-C300-Dgr-I-Mnd                              00950019
           If  R7919999-Retur-Abend                                     00960019
               Move  'C101'              To    R7919999-Paragraf        00970019
               Perform F7919010-Z900-Abend                              00980019
               Go To F7919010-C199-Exit                                 00990019
           End-If                                                       01000019
      *                                                                 01010019
      * Validerer datoen:                                               01020019
      *                                                                 01030019
           If  W9010-C100-Aar            <     1                        01040019
           or  W9010-C100-Mnd            <     1                        01050019
           or  W9010-C100-Mnd            >     12                       01060019
           or  W9010-C100-Dag            <     1                        01070019
           or  W9010-C100-Dag            >     W9010-C300-Dgr-Reell     01080019
               Move  Space               To    R7919999-Melding         01090019
               String 'Ugyldig dato - '        Delimited by size        01100019
                      W9010-C100-Aar           Delimited by size        01110021
                      '.'                      Delimited by size        01120019
                      W9010-C100-Mnd           Delimited by size        01130021
                      '.'                      Delimited by size        01140019
                      W9010-C100-Dag           Delimited by size        01150021
                      '.'                      Delimited by size        01160019
                                         Into  R7919999-Melding         01170019
               End-String                                               01180019
               Move  'C102'              To    R7919999-Paragraf        01190019
               Perform F7919010-Z900-Abend                              01200019
               Go To F7919010-C199-Exit                                 01210019
           End-If                                                       01220019
      *                                                                 01230019
      * Vi avgjør om vi starter med siste dag i måneden:                01240019
      *                                                                 01250019
           Evaluate True                                                01260019
             When W9010-C100-Dag         =     W9010-C300-Dgr-Reell     01270019
               Set   W9010-Siste-Dag-I-Mnd                              01280019
                                         To    True                     01290019
      *                                                                 01300019
             When R7919010-In-360-Dgr-Pr-Aar                            01310019
                                         In    R7919010-Dato-Pluss-Dager01320019
             and  W9010-C100-Dag         =     30                       01330019
               Set   W9010-Siste-Dag-I-Mnd                              01340019
                                         To    True                     01350019
      *                                                                 01360019
             When Other                                                 01370019
               Set   W9010-Ikke-Siste-Dag-I-Mnd                         01380019
                                         To    True                     01390019
      *                                                                 01400019
           End-Evaluate                                                 01410019
      *                                                                 01420019
           .                                                            01430019
       F7919010-C199-Exit.                                              01440019
           Exit.                                                        01450019
      *################################################################*01460019
